---
import DefaultLayout from '../components/layout/DefaultLayout.astro';
---

<DefaultLayout
  title="Terms of Service — CROW SYSTEMS"
  description="Read the Terms of Service for Crow Systems technology consulting services and website usage."
>
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-accent font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-4 block">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-lg leading-relaxed font-body">Please read these terms carefully before using our website or services.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">By accessing or using the Crow Systems website and services, you agree to comply with these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with these terms, you should not use the website or services.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">2. Services</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Crow Systems provides technology consulting, advisory services, digital solution planning, and related professional services. Services include systems consulting, IT infrastructure, software solutions, technical strategy, digital transformation, and automation consulting. All services are provided subject to availability and project scope agreements.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">3. Use of Website</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mb-4">Users agree to:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-on-surface-variant/80 font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6">
          <li>Use the website lawfully and in accordance with these terms.</li>
          <li>Avoid submitting malicious, abusive, or misleading content.</li>
          <li>Avoid attempting unauthorized access to systems or infrastructure.</li>
          <li>Avoid misuse of forms, APIs, or upload systems.</li>
          <li>Provide accurate and complete information when submitting inquiries or requests.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mt-4">Crow Systems reserves the right to block or restrict access to abusive users.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">4. Consultation Requests</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Submitting a consultation request does not establish a formal business relationship or contractual agreement. Project work, pricing, timelines, and deliverables require separate written agreements. Our team will review your submission and respond within 4 business hours.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">5. Audio Submissions</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mb-4">Users may voluntarily submit audio recordings through the website. By submitting audio content, users confirm:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-on-surface-variant/80 font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6">
          <li>They own or have rights to the submitted content.</li>
          <li>The content does not violate laws or third-party rights.</li>
          <li>The content does not contain malicious or prohibited material.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mt-4">Crow Systems reserves the right to reject or remove inappropriate submissions. Audio recordings are handled securely and used solely for consultation review purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">All website content, branding, design elements, text, graphics, and materials are the property of Crow Systems unless otherwise stated. Users may not reproduce, distribute, or reuse materials without prior written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mb-4">Crow Systems is not liable for:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-on-surface-variant/80 font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6">
          <li>Indirect or consequential damages</li>
          <li>Business interruption or loss of profits</li>
          <li>Data loss</li>
          <li>Third-party service outages</li>
          <li>Temporary website unavailability</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mt-4">All services are provided on an "as available" basis.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">8. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">The website may integrate with third-party providers including hosting, form processing, storage, analytics, and communication platforms. Crow Systems is not responsible for third-party service interruptions, policies, or data handling practices.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">9. Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Use of the website is also governed by our <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">10. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Crow Systems may update these Terms of Service periodically. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of updated terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">11. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant/80 leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Questions regarding these Terms may be sent to <a href="mailto:legal@crowsys.chrislabs.net" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">legal@crowsys.chrislabs.net</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
</DefaultLayout>